OL,4,CBoy, 3, died after choking in nursery, 
OL,5,Cinquest hears                          
OL,6,GA three-year-old boy died after        
OL,7,Gchoking at a Greater Manchester        
OL,8,Gnursery earlier this month, an inquest 
OL,9,Gheard.                                 
OL,11,FThiago Wall died on 5 November after   
OL,12,Fbecoming critically ill at Cosy Toes   
OL,13,FNursery, in Middleton, on 2 November.  
OL,15,FAn inquest at Rochdale Coroner's Court 
OL,16,Fheard on Wednesday that Thiago had     
OL,17,Fchoked on a bowl of food and died      
OL,18,Fthree days later at the Royal          
OL,19,FManchester Children's Hospital. A CT   
OL,20,Fscan later confirmed the toddler had   
OL,21,Fsuffered a brain injury.               
